<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>A failed call is not JSON, and JSONGetElement then returns its own error</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>message -- which starts with "?" and is not empty. Test the status too.</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Value><Calculation><![CDATA[$netError ≠ 0 or $status < 200 or $status > 299 or IsEmpty ( $b64 ) or Left ( $b64 ; 1 ) = "?"]]></Calculation></Value><Repetition><Calculation><![CDATA[1]]></Calculation></Repetition><Name>$callFailed</Name></Step>
